    "want": "First, Owen wants to get his coworkers out of the broken shop. Once they are safe, he wants to reach the inhabited cliff orchard for help, water, food and another skill—and because he cannot stop imagining the heights he could explore. Shared work with its inhabitants develops that personal excitement into a desire to make extraordinary places accessible to others without destroying the homes and cultivation that make those journeys possible."
