            "pursuit": "Find whoever maintains the gate while preserving a way back for both scouts.",
            "changes": [
              "Owen chooses to mark stable turns and wait at difficult sections instead of racing toward promising grafts. The delay lets him notice sleeping hollows and recently handled tools, evidence of ordinary lives interrupted by the terrain break.",
              "He hears movement near a damaged side channel and approaches without taking a patterned seed within reach. A small, furred, many-limbed person retreats with a tool raised.",
              "Owen lowers his rope and backs away from the tools, allowing the frightened stranger to remain nearby rather than turning the encounter into a chase."
            ],
