      "intent": "Develop limited communication through channel work, acquire Threadline through an accountable exchange and turn tentative contact into an enacted water-sharing relationship.",
      "adaptation": "The water agreement is completed in scene 12 rather than before the skill offer, preserving the specified contact payoff. Serri offers Threadline during the repair as an advance for nursery access; installation and imperfect use therefore have room before the agreement lands.",
      "scenes": [
        {
