              "By matching infected tissue to the old cuts and demonstrating its path through joined root sections, the cultivator shows Owen why bridges were cut: blight had traveled through shared growth. The active root proves the danger has not ended; the family marks show whom that protection has separated.",
              "Owen relays the observable findings with objects and drawings while the Vey conduct their own argument. Agreement about the disease does not make the relatives abandon reunion or the neighbors accept an open boundary.",
