        {
          "ordinal": 22,
          "brief": {
            "situation": "The work parties have materials and an agreed outlet, but current pressure prevents the diversion barrier from being seated. Owen reaches it first and finds that access alone gives him no way to hold the load.",
            "pursuit": "Assemble the right specialists and physical connections without sacrificing anyone to a heroic attempt.",
            "changes": [
              "Owen tries the bracing position unloaded and recognizes that the live force would overwhelm his grip. He relinquishes the central position and ferries connectors to Leanne rather than confuse his higher general rank with possessing Anchor.",
              "Leanne anchors through a fitted harness and a sound structural connection while workers guide the barrier. Her sustained, materially harder hold advances her specialty and gives them a period of control Owen could not supply.",
