      "scenes": [
        {
          "ordinal": 5,
          "brief": {
            "situation": "People wait around the supermarket frontage because nearby routes are disrupted. Owen wants to climb toward the lights, but Dev needs treatment and the intact stock offers a more immediate reason to stay.",
