            "changes": [
              "Owen combines Cling and a rested Air Step to inspect above the reachable ledge while Leanne anchors herself to support a properly secured safety line. His access reveals channel joints and moving water, not an obvious repair.",
              "Leanne sustains a harder, longer pull when loose debris loads the line. Her growing Anchor control keeps the approach usable while Owen must stop to recover his grip, making their different strengths practical rather than comparative boasting.",
              "Owen finds that the flow has been diverted at a fitted gate, with fresh tool marks beside it. He refuses to force a mechanism he does not understand and follows its maintenance path instead."
            ],
            "future_dependencies": [
              "The diversion must have a local purpose that Owen cannot infer merely by reaching it.",
              "Leanne's specialist development must later support loads Owen's movement skills cannot handle."
