          "brief": {
            "situation": "The repair needs work above a narrow channel where Serri can identify fittings but cannot safely brace against the shifted human-scale debris. Owen can reach the damaged lip; Leanne can hold the support line.",
            "pursuit": "Restore controlled flow without sending the gate's pressure into the hollows.",
            "changes": [
              "Owen holds position with Cling and places materials under Serri's direction while Leanne anchors through a secured hauling connection. A slipping brace forces them to stop and reset the mundane support rather than expect Owen's rank to supply engineering knowledge.",
              "Leanne's materially harder sustained hold advances her Anchor use again. Owen sees that repeating his familiar approach has not produced a fresh rank, while her increasingly difficult specialty is changing what the group can attempt.",
              "The repaired lip survives a limited test, but a safe opening still requires supervision. Across the broken nursery approach, Serri receives a response from the missing relative, who has stayed with drying grafts and cannot bring them back unaided."
            ],
            "future_dependencies": [
              "The relative's location is established here; the nursery expedition must help an already located person rather than repeat the search.",
              "The repair must earn trust without yet settling ongoing water rights."
