          "ordinal": 11,
          "brief": {
            "situation": "The channel can be tested under supervision, and Serri's relative remains stranded at the nursery. Owen's bulky rescue rope has repeatedly caught on the approach and left his hands occupied.",
            "pursuit": "Obtain a practical way to carry connections through difficult terrain while clarifying what Serri expects in return.",
            "changes": [
              "Serri offers a cultivated Threadline seed and indicates the nursery route, then demonstrates a temporary cord using the same permission already held in Serri's single Slot. Owen checks the permission by touch before accepting the seed as an advance for helping reach the nursery.",
              "Owen consumes the source and retains Cling and Air Step alongside Threadline; installation alone leaves his rank unchanged. Leanne declines a replacement source because relinquishing Anchor would remove the support the group currently relies on.",
              "During a guarded channel test, Owen joins touched sound surfaces to hold a small repair panel where carrying rope is awkward. His first controlled Threadline use under the water's real pressure earns SLOT RANK: 4.",
