            "changes": [
              "Owen follows Serri's opening sequence and keeps the repair panel steady while Leanne watches the downstream hollows. Flow reaches the nursery feeder without flooding the occupied lower ledges.",
              "Through marked container placement and a demonstrated gate position, they agree on limited collection that leaves the nursery supply running. Serri opens the collection point and helps Owen fill the first containers; Owen honors the stopping signal despite wanting to take more.",
              "Owen returns treated water to the shop and reports the limits as part of the arrangement, not an inconvenience to evade. Serri accepts the next nursery departure with him, making reciprocal contact an accomplished exchange rather than a hopeful interpretation."
            ],
            "future_dependencies": [
              "The nursery expedition must fulfill Owen's accepted obligation.",
              "The water arrangement must remain limited and dependent on maintaining the shared channel."
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
